  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f5dcffc070f2c7d45a208d446b2d3945, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::VocaloidTCG.StoryData
  id: story-tutorial
  tutorial: 1
  tutorialMessagePrefab: {fileID: 4169471783399215178, guid: 9a7e27d942198db49b51fb1107322d09, type: 3}
  tutorialExpressions:
  - {fileID: -772454078125462199, guid: c27636dc5f7cbbb468012701b90daea9, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 531467281934478826, guid: b5204f013456e4745a67aceb894cb700, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 1414087313690171253, guid: bd2e8b9a35e8b5740a210eeda43ff22c, type: 3}
  storyClass: 0
  header: Tutorial
  playerStarterDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e18f2953280683638d63d0909bf206da, type: 2}
  prologue:
    lines:
    - speaker: Narrator
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: Behind the curtain, the venue is still quiet. Empty stage tiles glow
        beneath the rehearsal lights.
      avatars:
      - slot: 2
        sprite: {fileID: -772454078125462199, guid: c27636dc5f7cbbb468012701b90daea9, type: 3}
    - speaker: Miku
      portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: There you are! I saved you a spot for sound check.
      avatars:
      - slot: 2
        sprite: {fileID: 531467281934478826, guid: b5204f013456e4745a67aceb894cb700, type: 3}
    - speaker: Miku
      portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: Before the audience arrives, let's turn a few cards into a performance.
      avatars:
      - slot: 2
        sprite: {fileID: -772454078125462199, guid: c27636dc5f7cbbb468012701b90daea9, type: 3}
    - speaker: Miku
      portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: We'll practice together, one audition at a time. You don't have to know
        every trick yet.
      avatars:
      - slot: 2
        sprite: {fileID: -772454078125462199, guid: c27636dc5f7cbbb468012701b90daea9, type: 3}
    - speaker: Miku
      portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: A little teamwork, a well-timed cheer... even a small stage can feel
        huge!
      avatars:
      - slot: 2
        sprite: {fileID: 531467281934478826, guid: b5204f013456e4745a67aceb894cb700, type: 3}
    - speaker: Narrator
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: Miku places a starter deck in your hands. Beyond the curtain, the first
        beat begins.
      avatars:
      - slot: 2
        sprite: {fileID: -772454078125462199, guid: c27636dc5f7cbbb468012701b90daea9, type: 3}
    - speaker: Miku
      portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: Ready? Let's start with the opening act!
      avatars:
      - slot: 2
        sprite: {fileID: 531467281934478826, guid: b5204f013456e4745a67aceb894cb700, type: 3}
  epilogue:
    lines:
    - speaker: Narrator
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: The final rehearsal ends on a bright chord. This time, you know exactly
        why the crowd is cheering.
      avatars:
      - slot: 2
        sprite: {fileID: 531467281934478826, guid: b5204f013456e4745a67aceb894cb700, type: 3}
    - speaker: Miku
      portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: You did it! From your first performer to your first full match... that
        was your show.
      avatars:
      - slot: 2
        sprite: {fileID: 531467281934478826, guid: b5204f013456e4745a67aceb894cb700, type: 3}
    - speaker: Miku
      portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: Keep an eye on your energy, support your performers, and make every round
        count.
      avatars:
      - slot: 2
        sprite: {fileID: -772454078125462199, guid: c27636dc5f7cbbb468012701b90daea9, type: 3}
    - speaker: Miku
      portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: And if a plan falls apart? Take a breath. There's always another way
        to play the stage.
      avatars:
      - slot: 2
        sprite: {fileID: 531467281934478826, guid: b5204f013456e4745a67aceb894cb700, type: 3}
    - speaker: Narrator
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: The practice lights fade. Beyond the curtain, new rivals and new songs
        are waiting.
      avatars:
      - slot: 2
        sprite: {fileID: -772454078125462199, guid: c27636dc5f7cbbb468012701b90daea9, type: 3}
    - speaker: Miku
      portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: Your next performance is up to you. I'll see you at on the center stage!
      avatars:
      - slot: 2
        sprite: {fileID: 531467281934478826, guid: b5204f013456e4745a67aceb894cb700, type: 3}
